		(company "14MM47 / reading_light")
		(comment 1 "Charge 417 mA (R3 2.4k). Slide switch is the only on/off (Matt). VSYS 3.3-4.2 V on battery, ~4.15 V on USB.")
		(comment 2 "J3 carries VSYS (not 3.3 V) on the Qwiic pinout: never plug a 3.3 V-only Qwiic device into it.")
		(comment 3 "J2 polarity: + on pin 1 (silk). Q3 blocks a reversed battery; meter every pack before plugging in.")
